      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1697 Ursuline nuns founded the first school in the settlement, helping to educate local Indigenous peoples.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trois-Rivi%C3%A8res",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Université du Québec à Trois‑Rivières opened in 1969, famous for its chiropractic and podiatric programs.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
